Check schema: each reaction node's children are molecules (no extra). Good. Each molecule that has children has exactly one child (a reaction). In our structure, the molecule "Cc1ccc(NS(=O)(=O)c2ccc(C=CC(=O)O)cc2)cc1" has children list containing one reaction (863416). Good. The molecule "Cc1ccc(NS(=O)(=O)c2ccc(C=O)cc2)cc1" has children list containing one reaction (214705). Good.

